All of my cards are becoming infected!

247
00:16:00,640 --> 00:16:02,357
That's what you get, Kaiba boy,

248
00:16:02,440 --> 00:16:04,497
when you stack your
deck with monster cards

249
00:16:04,580 --> 00:16:07,227
that all have more than
1,500 offense points.

250
00:16:08,060 --> 00:16:09,257
I don't believe it.

251
00:16:09,340 --> 00:16:12,877
Kaiba's getting done in by the same
card that he tried to beat Yugi with.

252
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:19,760
This can't be it that crush card totally
obliterated his deck all of my cards gone

253
00:16:20,360 --> 00:16:22,697
This is the only one left that the virus

254
00:16:22,780 --> 00:16:25,820
didn't affect so it's
the only card I can play

255
00:16:26,420 --> 00:16:29,820
I've used reborn the monster
to revive soggy the clown

256
00:16:30,680 --> 00:16:34,680
It's your last move and you're
going to spend it reviving a clown.

257
00:16:34,920 --> 00:16:36,177
Oh, yes, that's right,

258
00:16:36,260 --> 00:16:38,577
Kaiba He's the best you
can do with my virus still

259
00:16:38,660 --> 00:16:42,000
about shame when you consider
all that's on the line

260
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:47,240
Mokuba, I've tried my very best.

261
00:16:47,640 --> 00:16:49,780
Your best failed you.

262
00:16:50,620 --> 00:16:52,580
Mikuri Box, emerge and attack.

263
00:17:01,940 --> 00:17:03,580
Forgive me, Mokuba.

264
00:17:03,840 --> 00:17:05,540
I am so sorry.

265
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:13,790
No way!

266
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:19,096
There are no more cards you can play.

267
00:17:19,360 --> 00:17:21,580
Therefore, you lose, Kaiba boy.

268
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:27,237
And you've lost much more than
just this duel, haven't you, Kaiba?

269
00:17:27,320 --> 00:17:31,097
You've lost the only chance you
had at rescuing your baby brother.

270
00:17:31,180 --> 00:17:32,640
You let him down.

271
00:17:33,060 --> 00:17:34,942
But don't worry, my dear friend.

272
00:17:35,240 --> 00:17:39,320
I will spare you the agony of
carrying on in this world without him.

273
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:40,997
What is that?

274
00:17:41,080 --> 00:17:45,020
It is the final fate of
your soul, Seto Kaiba.

275
00:17:50,840 --> 00:17:55,060
Welcome to your new home, a
place of solitude and seclusion.

276
00:17:55,560 --> 00:18:00,300
And while your soul is away, your body
will be employed as my obedient servant.

277
00:18:02,240 --> 00:18:05,460
The Brothers Kaiba, one in each hand.

278
00:18:05,680 --> 00:18:07,917
But even though your
cards are so very close,

279
00:18:08,000 --> 00:18:09,837
your souls have never been further apart.

280
00:18:09,920 --> 00:18:12,620
At least when I had Mokava locked up,

281
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:15,918
you were both still living
within the same dimension.

282
00:18:16,800 --> 00:18:19,160
But now you're worlds apart.

283
00:18:21,820 --> 00:18:23,700
Take away that empty shell.

284
00:18:24,240 --> 00:18:26,416
Teach it to wash dishes or something.

285
00:18:30,340 --> 00:18:34,040
Okay, tell me I didn't just
see what I think I saw. Kaiba!

286
00:18:34,380 --> 00:18:35,380
He's gone too.

287
00:18:35,720 --> 00:18:39,426
Just because he was only trying
to help his little brother out.

288
00:18:41,480 --> 00:18:43,100
He was like us.

289
00:18:43,340 --> 00:18:45,928
He just wanted to save
someone he cared for.

290
00:18:47,460 --> 00:18:48,500
Why, Pegasus?

291
00:18:50,300 --> 00:18:53,260
Who are you to toy with
our friends? Our families?

292
00:18:53,840 --> 00:18:55,800
I won't let you get away with it!

293
00:18:58,220 --> 00:19:00,380
Just try and stop me, little Yugi.

294
00:19:05,500 --> 00:19:06,440
Yugi-oh!

295
00:19:15,020 --> 00:19:15,850
Well,

296
00:19:15,933 --> 00:19:20,420
I do believe I've just sensed Yugi tapping
into the power of his Millennium Item.

297
00:19:21,080 --> 00:19:21,910
Excellent.

298
00:19:22,160 --> 00:19:26,160
Pegasus, it won't be long now
till I put an end to your games.

299
00:19:26,500 --> 00:19:27,360
Yugi boy,

300
00:19:27,660 --> 00:19:30,477
don't forget that you still have
to make it through the remaining

301
00:19:30,560 --> 00:19:34,577
rounds of this tournament to even
win the privilege of challenging me.

302
00:19:34,660 --> 00:19:37,157
Rest assured, I'll be at the finals.

303
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:40,357
But the true privilege will
be defeating you and undoing

304
00:19:40,440 --> 00:19:43,616
all the evil acts you've
committed against my friends.

305
00:19:44,040 --> 00:19:47,600
I look forward to your
finest efforts, Yugi boy,

306
00:19:47,800 --> 00:19:51,360
and wonderful performances
from all our finalists.

307
00:19:51,960 --> 00:19:54,720
You truly are the best of the best.

308
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:56,580
The creme de la creme.

309
00:19:58,020 --> 00:20:04,820
But even so, with the power of my millennium
eye, nothing will keep me from victory.

310
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:10,980
Not even Yugi and his Millennium Puzzle!
